---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Cookie policy | SecretariatPro"
  description="Information about cookies and similar technologies used by SecretariatPro."
>
  <section class="page-hero legal-hero">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal>
      <h1>Cookie policy</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        Information about the technologies used by secretariatproapp.com.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="shell legal-shell">
      <article class="legal-content" data-reveal>

        <section>
          <h2>What cookies are</h2>

          <p>
            Cookies are small files or storage technologies that certain
            websites may use to store or retrieve information on a user's
            device while browsing.
          </p>

          <p>
            They may be used, among other purposes, to enable the technical
            operation of a website, remember preferences, obtain statistics
            or track browsing behaviour.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Cookies used by SecretariatPro</h2>

          <p>
            At present, secretariatproapp.com does not use cookies for
            advertising, profiling or behavioural tracking purposes.
          </p>

          <p>
            The website may use only technical technologies necessary to
            ensure its operation, security, availability and correct
            delivery.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Analytics</h2>

          <p>
            We currently do not use web analytics tools that install
            cookies intended to analyse individual visitor behaviour.
          </p>

          <p>
            If analytics tools requiring consent are introduced in the
            future, this policy will be updated before they are used and
            the necessary mechanisms will be provided so that users can
            accept or reject those technologies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Advertising and profiling</h2>

          <p>
            SecretariatPro does not currently use behavioural advertising
            cookies or technologies intended to create commercial profiles
            of website users.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Multimedia content</h2>

          <p>
            Videos currently displayed on the website are hosted directly
            as part of the site and do not require external players from
            advertising or social platforms.
          </p>

          <p>
            If third-party content such as embedded videos, maps, social
            networks or other services using their own cookies is added in
            the future, this policy will be reviewed and consent will be
            requested where necessary.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Third-party cookies</h2>

          <p>
            We do not knowingly use third-party cookies for advertising,
            measurement or tracking purposes at present.
          </p>

          <p>
            Certain infrastructure providers may process technical
            information necessary to provide and protect the service
            without this necessarily involving the installation of cookies
            in the user's browser.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Browser controls</h2>

          <p>
            Major browsers allow users to view, block or delete cookies
            stored on their device through privacy and configuration
            settings.
          </p>

          <p>
            Blocking certain strictly necessary technologies could affect
            the correct operation of some pages or services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

          <p>
            SecretariatPro may update this Cookie Policy when new features,
            third-party services or technologies change the current use of
            cookies.
          </p>

          <p>
            If cookies requiring consent are introduced, an appropriate
            system will be provided for their acceptance, rejection and
            configuration before they are installed where required by law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact</h2>

          <p>
            If you have any questions about the use of cookies or similar
            technologies on this website, you can contact us at:
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="mailto:a.garciarenones@gmail.com">
              a.garciarenones@gmail.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-update">
          <p>Last updated: September 2026.</p>
        </section>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
